  "name": "Deepfacelive-DFM-Models",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDescription\n\t\n\n\n\nHere you can find files for DeepFaceLab(It's back!) and DeepFaceLive. All sources and active community members are listed below.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDisclaimer\n\t\n\n\nThe author of this repository makes no claim to the data uploaded here other than that created by himself. Feel free to open a discussion for me to mention your contacts if I haven't done so. \n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tQuick usage guide\n\t\n\nTo use the models presented in the repository, you will need installed DeepFaceLive.\n\n.dfm models\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dimanchkek/Deepfacelive-DFM-Models.",
